{"name":"附表三十二","title":"異位性皮膚炎面積暨嚴重度指數【Eczema Area and Severity Index (EASI)】","updated":"113.01.25","url":"https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/dl-42763-8eb8a48752b84f899d54f9b30bb3c83f-1.pdf","extractor_version":3,"formlines_version":1,"clauses":[{"text":"1","level":0},{"text":"附表三十二：異位性皮膚炎面積暨嚴重度指數【Eczema Area and Severity","level":0},{"text":"Index (EASI)】","level":0},{"text":"     異位性皮膚炎面積（Area）：合併總面積佔體表%____________","level":0},{"text":"TB0","level":0},{"text":"     部位：頭部(h)、軀幹(t)、上肢(u)、下肢(l)","level":0},{"text":"     異位性皮膚炎嚴重度（Severity）：","level":0},{"text":"TB1","level":0},{"text":"異位性皮膚炎面積暨嚴重程度指數(EASI)評分表：","level":0},{"text":"8歲以上病人：","level":0},{"text":"TB2","level":0},{"text":"EASI = 0.1 (Red＋Edema＋Scratch＋Lichenification)×(頭部%)＋0.3 (Red＋Edema＋Scratch","level":0},{"text":"＋Lichenification)×(軀幹%)＋0.2 (Red＋Edema＋Scratch＋Lichenification)×(上肢%)＋","level":0},{"text":"0.4(Red＋Edema＋Scratch＋Lichenification)×(下肢%)","level":0},{"text":"2","level":0},{"text":"未滿8歲病人：","level":0},{"text":"TB3","level":0},{"text":"EASI = 0.2 (Red＋Edema＋Scratch＋Lichenification)×(頭部%)＋0.3 (Red＋Edema＋Scratch","level":0},{"text":"＋Lichenification)×(軀幹%)+0.2 (Red＋Edema＋Scratch＋Lichenification)×(上肢%)＋","level":0},{"text":"0.3(Red＋Edema＋Scratch＋Lichenification)×(下肢%)","level":0},{"text":"附註：Eczema area severity index (EASI)之異位性皮膚炎面積計算，只含皮膚紅腫濕疹部","level":0},{"text":"位，單純的皮膚乾燥、脫皮、抓痕，不可列入計算。","level":0}],"tables":[{"page":0,"bbox":[76.8,124.0,518.9,198.9],"strategy":"lines_strict","rows":2,"cols":8,"density":1.0,"grid":[["涵蓋程度","0﹪","1-9﹪","10-29﹪","30-49﹪","50-69﹪","70-89﹪","90-100﹪"],["面積分數","0","1","2","3","4","5","6"]],"lossless":true},{"page":0,"bbox":[76.8,245.2,518.9,304.3],"strategy":"lines_strict","rows":2,"cols":5,"density":1.0,"grid":[["嚴重度","None無","Mild輕度","Moderate中度","Severe重度"],["分數","0","1","2","3"]],"lossless":true},{"page":0,"bbox":[39.2,407.0,556.4,628.2],"strategy":"lines_strict","rows":6,"cols":8,"density":0.792,"grid":[["身體部位","Redness/ Erythema發紅(0-3)","Edema/ Papulation浮